### 2. Security Scanning

#### Snyk IaC Scanning

```bash
# Run Snyk Infrastructure as Code scan
snyk iac test --json > snyk-report.json

# Example findings
{
  "vulnerabilities": [
    {
      "id": "SNYK-CC-TF-1",
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "title": "Security group allows unrestricted ingress",
      "resource": "aws_security_group.web",
      "location": {
        "file": "security.tf",
        "line": 15
      },
      "description": "Security group rule allows traffic from 0.0.0.0/0",
      "fix": "Restrict ingress to specific CIDR blocks"
    }
  ]
}
```

